WEBVTT

01:31.835 --> 01:37.064
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.064 --> 01:39.656
[Episode 26]

01:47.159 --> 01:49.319
You cooked so much. I can't finish it all.

01:49.319 --> 01:50.560
If you want to thank me,

01:50.560 --> 01:52.640
I prefer money.

01:52.640 --> 01:54.760
You forgot your manners again.

01:55.519 --> 01:57.359
Fu and Chuanyu are waiting to eat this.

02:07.879 --> 02:09.080
Aren't you tired?

02:09.080 --> 02:10.184
No, I'm not.

02:11.759 --> 02:12.840
Can we stop?

02:12.840 --> 02:13.928
No way!

02:21.439 --> 02:24.520
Great, I can drink again.

02:27.960 --> 02:29.680
Here's to our perfect cooperation.

02:32.199 --> 02:33.288
Here.

02:49.039 --> 02:50.088
What are you thinking about?

02:54.800 --> 02:57.919
The wish I made when I came to Chang'an

02:58.960 --> 03:00.280
is about to come true.

03:01.800 --> 03:02.824
What wish?

03:04.280 --> 03:07.199
You'll naturally know when it comes true.

03:10.000 --> 03:12.800
You've finished the millet case successfully?

03:12.800 --> 03:14.080
Did you get what you wished for?

03:14.719 --> 03:18.280
Of course, I must get what I want.

03:25.416 --> 03:26.479
Wenqing.

03:26.479 --> 03:28.000
Mudan.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.479
We are eating.

03:29.479 --> 03:30.479
Come on in and join us.

03:30.479 --> 03:31.520
No, thanks.

03:32.080 --> 03:34.000
I've been busy with my work.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.439
I heard about your mishap yesterday.

03:36.039 --> 03:37.128
I arrived late.

03:37.128 --> 03:39.840
It's alright. I'm fine.

03:41.319 --> 03:43.960
How can it be good for you to be with him?

03:45.080 --> 03:48.439
Mudan, you and I are related.

03:48.439 --> 03:50.159
I don't mind that you were an official servant.

03:50.159 --> 03:52.120
I don't care that you were in the barracks.

03:52.120 --> 03:54.120
Nor will I mind
that you're Mr. Jiang's servant.

03:54.639 --> 03:56.520
I know you were forced into all of this.

03:57.360 --> 03:59.960
So, what are you trying to say?

04:04.840 --> 04:06.039
I'm willing to take you as a concubine

04:06.639 --> 04:07.800
to save you from all of this.

04:11.560 --> 04:13.560
Li Xing.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.719
Before, I only thought

04:14.719 --> 04:16.479
you were just a bookworm.

04:16.479 --> 04:18.639
I didn't expect you to

04:18.639 --> 04:19.839
be so self-confident.

04:20.519 --> 04:21.576
You stay out of this.

04:22.360 --> 04:26.360
Mudan, I don't have romantic feelings for you,

04:26.360 --> 04:27.600
but I never look down on you.

04:30.240 --> 04:31.279
I mean,

04:31.279 --> 04:32.360
once you marry me,

04:32.360 --> 04:33.839
I won't let you suffer again.

04:34.519 --> 04:37.560
The civilians and the pariahs don't intermarry.

04:38.480 --> 04:39.519
You can't marry her.

04:40.968 --> 04:42.056
I can buy you first.

04:42.056 --> 04:43.080
Rest assured,

04:43.080 --> 04:45.560
I won't treat you like a servant.

04:45.560 --> 04:47.199
Anyway, let me help you

04:47.199 --> 04:48.399
go through the difficult times.

04:49.040 --> 04:50.079
You will always be my cousin.

04:50.079 --> 04:52.520
Wenqing, are you drunk?

04:52.520 --> 04:53.639
- Mudan.
- I--

04:53.639 --> 04:55.112
- Mudan.
- I never drink--

04:55.112 --> 04:56.319
Liu Chang?

04:56.319 --> 04:57.920
- I've finally seen you.
- I don't want to see you.

04:57.920 --> 04:58.959
Get out of here.

04:58.959 --> 05:00.319
Mudan,

05:00.319 --> 05:02.000
don't you want Shuai either?

05:03.432 --> 05:04.480
- Mudan.
- You leave.

05:04.480 --> 05:07.439
Mudan, when you were
in the barracks, I wrote to you.

05:07.439 --> 05:08.959
Why would you rather be a servant

05:08.959 --> 05:11.519
than let me help you
get rid of your servant status and marry me?

05:11.519 --> 05:13.600
That is because you are unfaithful.

05:14.759 --> 05:17.600
Mudan, he is about
to marry the County Princess,

05:17.600 --> 05:18.839
a noble woman.

05:18.839 --> 05:21.160
And you, as a lowly servant,
can't even be a concubine.

05:21.160 --> 05:23.399
If his wife intends to kill you,
how will you protect yourself?

05:23.399 --> 05:26.160
No, to save my father's life,

05:26.160 --> 05:27.839
I have no choice
but to marry the County Princess.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.959
Mudan, do not get me wrong.

05:30.560 --> 05:31.639
Show some respect.

05:32.959 --> 05:34.199
Don't listen to him.

05:34.199 --> 05:36.720
Mudan, I've already rented a house.

05:36.720 --> 05:39.319
As long as you're with me, I'll protect you.

05:39.319 --> 05:40.680
I won't let anyone hurt you.

05:40.680 --> 05:42.600
You won't have to be a servant anymore.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.079
Your father was corrupt.

05:44.079 --> 05:45.879
And you've sold out your marriage

05:45.879 --> 05:47.319
and sided with bad officials for your career.

05:48.079 --> 05:50.600
Though Mudan is a merchant, she has her pride.

05:50.600 --> 05:52.720
She never likes someone unfaithful like you.

05:52.720 --> 05:54.279
You don't like her.

05:54.279 --> 05:56.000
Why do you compete with me then?

05:56.000 --> 05:57.680
I am her cousin.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.959
She is now trapped in a difficult situation.

05:58.959 --> 06:00.399
How can I stand by and do nothing?

06:00.399 --> 06:02.240
My family has a good reputation.

06:02.240 --> 06:04.079
I will marry a virtuous wife.

06:04.079 --> 06:06.519
So, Mudan should be with me.
That's the best for her.

06:06.519 --> 06:09.519
Wenqing, Liu Chang is out of his mind.

06:09.519 --> 06:11.600
Why are you as crazy as him?

06:11.600 --> 06:13.680
Have you even asked me what I think?

06:13.680 --> 06:14.759
- Jiang Xiaohua.
- Well--

06:15.439 --> 06:16.839
Haven't you understood yet?

06:16.839 --> 06:18.040
With your current status,

06:18.040 --> 06:19.519
there's no need for your opinion.

06:20.040 --> 06:23.120
In fact, the person
they should be asking is me.

06:24.519 --> 06:26.279
I have the indenture for buying He Weifang.

06:26.279 --> 06:28.480
The highest bidder gets it. Make your offer.

06:28.480 --> 06:29.879
Get out of here.

06:30.439 --> 06:31.639
It's already a mess.

06:31.639 --> 06:33.000
Can you stay out of this?

06:33.000 --> 06:34.879
Come on. I'm helping.

06:34.879 --> 06:36.800
I am telling them what to do.

06:36.800 --> 06:40.199
Why does Mr. Jiang always make fun of Mudan?

06:41.879 --> 06:45.399
Lady He is getting Mr. Jiang into trouble.

06:45.399 --> 06:47.120
Nonsense. You watch yourself.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.519
Yes, she's making trouble.

06:48.519 --> 06:51.279
Without me, how will you explain it all?

06:51.279 --> 06:53.480
The two of you, don't flatter yourself.

06:53.480 --> 06:56.120
I'm doing very well.
I don't need anyone to help me.

06:56.120 --> 06:57.120
Get out of here.

06:57.120 --> 06:58.376
Sober up.

06:58.376 --> 06:59.399
Listen, Mudan.

06:59.399 --> 07:00.480
- Mudan.
- Mudan.

07:00.480 --> 07:01.576
I understand.

07:01.576 --> 07:03.480
Are you afraid of Jiang Changyang's power?

07:03.480 --> 07:04.560
So, you dare not speak?

07:04.560 --> 07:06.319
No worries. Although I'm not rich,

07:06.319 --> 07:08.319
I'll raise enough money to redeem you.

07:08.319 --> 07:10.480
Mudan, whether I am drunk or not,

07:10.480 --> 07:12.000
what I said is all sincere.

07:12.000 --> 07:13.600
Jiang Changyang is dissolute and unruly.

07:13.600 --> 07:14.920
Li Xing is dull.

07:14.920 --> 07:16.720
You and I are the same kind of people.

07:16.720 --> 07:17.800
- Mudan.
- Leave!

07:17.800 --> 07:19.912
- Get lost!
- Mudan.

07:19.912 --> 07:21.720
- Get lost.
- Calm down, Mudan.

07:21.720 --> 07:22.720
- Get out of here!
- I…

07:23.399 --> 07:24.904
- Get lost!
- Mudan.

07:24.904 --> 07:25.959
Mudan.

07:25.959 --> 07:27.080
- Mudan.
- Listen to me.

07:27.080 --> 07:28.168
I'll surely treat you well.

07:28.168 --> 07:29.600
- Mudan.
- Mudan.

07:29.600 --> 07:31.600
Mudan, please hear me out.

07:32.648 --> 07:34.792
Mudan.

07:36.136 --> 07:37.240
Mudan.

07:37.240 --> 07:38.399
Why have you closed the door?

07:38.399 --> 07:39.519
Mudan.

07:39.519 --> 07:41.319
Open the door, Mudan.

07:41.319 --> 07:43.800
Mudan.

07:43.800 --> 07:45.480
Mudan, listen to me.

07:56.040 --> 07:58.319
Mudan. I like Mudan.

07:58.879 --> 08:00.600
Shuai is the cutest.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.079
I can't believe this.

08:02.879 --> 08:04.319
This is so absurd.

08:05.279 --> 08:08.279
I think it's quite interesting.

08:11.040 --> 08:12.040
In this case,

08:12.040 --> 08:14.720
[The one who marries first is a dog, Suizhi]
I'll win the bet soon.

08:14.720 --> 08:15.959
You wish.

08:15.959 --> 08:17.040
I've come to realize

08:17.600 --> 08:19.879
the people around me, including you,

08:19.879 --> 08:21.160
are all crazy.

08:22.639 --> 08:26.120
The best thing to do is make money.

08:26.120 --> 08:27.160
Am I right, Shuai?

08:36.080 --> 08:38.080
After coming to Chang'an,

08:38.080 --> 08:40.120
I always felt that I had earned a lot.

08:41.080 --> 08:43.720
But when I want to buy a place,

08:43.720 --> 08:45.919
I realize I haven't earned enough money.

08:45.919 --> 08:47.840
Our business is too small.

08:48.360 --> 08:50.039
It's not that we earn too little money.

08:50.039 --> 08:51.679
It's that the land prices
in Chang'an are too high.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.679
Fu.

08:56.679 --> 08:58.600
Has your mother agreed

08:58.600 --> 09:00.039
with my idea?

09:00.039 --> 09:01.200
Sure, she has.

09:02.320 --> 09:04.679
Great, before we head to the pawnshop tomorrow,

09:04.679 --> 09:06.440
I will draft the contract.

09:06.440 --> 09:08.399
I take the risk of the mortgage loan myself.

09:08.399 --> 09:09.512
I won't let you--

09:09.512 --> 09:10.799
What are you talking about?

09:11.879 --> 09:13.320
We're afraid of losing money.

09:14.159 --> 09:16.440
I'm just worried that you're too tired.

09:16.440 --> 09:19.519
You're borrowing so much money
to buy such a big place.

09:19.519 --> 09:21.360
What if something goes wrong
and we can't repay the money,

09:22.240 --> 09:24.000
losing Huamanzhu?

09:24.000 --> 09:25.080
Aren't you afraid?

09:27.039 --> 09:28.679
Of course, I am.

09:29.320 --> 09:32.279
But to expand the business,
how can we not take any risks?

09:33.519 --> 09:35.120
The pawnshop lends us money

09:35.120 --> 09:37.039
because our business is good.

09:37.600 --> 09:39.240
Your mother agreed decisively

09:39.240 --> 09:40.960
because she was already sure

09:40.960 --> 09:43.000
Huamanzhu was meant to grow big.

09:44.320 --> 09:46.679
If we acquire Fragrance Garden,

09:46.679 --> 09:49.399
we will have more space to try new varieties.

09:49.399 --> 09:52.440
And we can rent it out to host banquets.

09:52.440 --> 09:55.279
We will make a lot of money.

09:56.520 --> 09:57.600
How much?

09:57.600 --> 09:58.696
Very much.

09:59.519 --> 10:02.480
Okay, as soon as we borrow the money,
we'll go straight to Fragrance Garden.

10:03.771 --> 10:06.376
[Fragrance Garden]

10:09.352 --> 10:10.472
Mr. Lv.

10:10.472 --> 10:11.600
Lady He.

10:13.639 --> 10:15.000
You have a good eye.

10:15.559 --> 10:18.000
It's a pity that you are late.

10:18.000 --> 10:21.360
I've already bought this place.

10:26.120 --> 10:30.799
Mr. Lv, the flower guild has properties
all over Chang'an.

10:30.799 --> 10:33.759
I suppose you don't have to have this place.

10:33.759 --> 10:36.039
Could you transfer it to me?

10:36.039 --> 10:37.720
Even if I agree,

10:37.720 --> 10:39.200
I'm afraid

10:39.799 --> 10:42.799
you can't afford a pavilion
in Fragrance Garden.

10:43.639 --> 10:45.879
Don't underestimate us.

10:45.879 --> 10:47.960
What's inside here is bullion.

10:47.960 --> 10:48.968
Fu.

10:50.519 --> 10:54.759
That's all you have, isn't it?

10:54.759 --> 10:55.960
It's borrowed from the pawnshop?

10:59.600 --> 11:01.879
Since you're the master of this garden,

11:01.879 --> 11:04.639
I want to do this deal with you.

11:04.639 --> 11:07.320
Can we have a word

11:07.320 --> 11:08.840
in Fuguilou?

11:10.519 --> 11:11.879
You haven't been in Chang'an for long.

11:12.480 --> 11:15.200
It's not easy for you to borrow so much money.

11:15.960 --> 11:19.080
However, you're not rich enough.

11:19.080 --> 11:22.480
Most of the merchants
can't afford a private garden.

11:22.480 --> 11:27.000
I advise you to buy a smaller garden
in remote places.

11:28.559 --> 11:31.960
Frankly speaking,
this garden means a lot to me.

11:31.960 --> 11:33.039
I just want to buy it.

11:33.559 --> 11:36.399
What should I do to make you sell it to me?

11:38.519 --> 11:40.399
In the cultivation of famous flowers,

11:40.399 --> 11:42.679
you've indeed outperformed the flower guild.

11:42.679 --> 11:45.279
However, the flower guild has a large business.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.320
You should understand

11:47.320 --> 11:50.960
that no matter how talented you are,
not everything will go your way.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.679
I can't sell this garden

11:54.360 --> 11:56.720
to you. Excuse me.

12:02.879 --> 12:05.039
How about we ask Chun for help?

12:06.720 --> 12:11.039
No, we can't force anyone
to make a deal with us.

12:11.039 --> 12:12.080
We can't put Chun on the spot.

12:14.279 --> 12:15.304
Don't worry.

12:16.639 --> 12:18.120
Anyway, we've waited for so long already.

12:18.799 --> 12:20.720
I can wait a little longer.

12:22.240 --> 12:24.679
Should we return this money to the pawnshop?

12:26.679 --> 12:28.600
Even if we don't buy Fragrance Garden,

12:28.600 --> 12:30.320
we still have to open branch stores.

12:30.840 --> 12:32.600
Since we've borrowed the money,

12:32.600 --> 12:35.039
we must find a way to earn interest on money.

12:35.879 --> 12:37.679
Let's first deposit the gold

12:37.679 --> 12:39.000
and watch shops in the East Market.

12:40.759 --> 12:41.896
Let's go.

12:42.696 --> 12:49.576
[Fragrance Garden]

12:59.600 --> 13:02.039
New alcohol on the market today.

13:02.039 --> 13:03.480
Welcome to have a try.

13:04.923 --> 13:07.519
[Huamanzhu]

13:07.519 --> 13:09.519
Today, Huamanzhu is opening in the East Market.

13:09.519 --> 13:11.080
Everyone, please come in.

13:11.080 --> 13:15.368
[Opening]

13:43.759 --> 13:45.600
Where did you get the money for this?

13:52.480 --> 13:54.039
Did He Weifang give you money

13:54.039 --> 13:55.759
behind my back?

13:57.639 --> 13:58.696
Speak.

14:01.720 --> 14:03.799
Speak!

14:06.879 --> 14:08.159
You like embroidery?

14:09.799 --> 14:11.159
Look.

14:11.159 --> 14:13.159
It's broken.

14:14.840 --> 14:17.360
It's broken.

14:30.840 --> 14:31.944
You bitch.

14:54.200 --> 14:55.304
Wang Qing.

15:55.208 --> 15:56.232
I want five of them.

15:56.232 --> 15:58.200
Alright, please pay here.

15:58.200 --> 16:00.440
I'll deliver it to your house later.

16:00.440 --> 16:02.519
- Thanks.
- It's been loaded for you.

16:02.519 --> 16:03.656
Thank you.

16:04.759 --> 16:06.240
Mudan.

16:06.240 --> 16:08.240
Chun's beauty cream is selling well.

16:08.799 --> 16:10.039
We're making a fortune.

16:13.240 --> 16:14.344
What's wrong?

16:16.000 --> 16:18.679
Nothing. I remember

16:19.279 --> 16:22.120
when our first store opened,

16:22.120 --> 16:24.559
Shengyi used all her savings

16:25.320 --> 16:27.240
to redeem this jade pendant

16:27.759 --> 16:29.120
as a gift for me.

16:30.360 --> 16:31.679
If she is here,

16:32.320 --> 16:34.799
she should be the one managing this store.

16:35.440 --> 16:37.279
I'm wondering how she is doing now.

16:38.720 --> 16:39.960
Alright, stop thinking about it.

16:40.936 --> 16:41.992
Alright.

16:41.992 --> 16:43.559
I'm just feeling sentimental. No worries.

16:43.559 --> 16:46.639
Lady He, a lady asked me to hand this to you.

16:46.639 --> 16:48.000
She congratulates you on the opening.

16:48.840 --> 16:49.960
Thank you.

16:53.120 --> 16:54.200
You take a look.

16:59.080 --> 17:01.519
One day, I'll embroider more for you.

17:01.519 --> 17:03.360
No matter how sweaty you get,

17:03.360 --> 17:05.359
you'll always have a clean handkerchief to use.

17:05.359 --> 17:06.472
It's from Shengyi.

17:10.907 --> 17:13.512
[Huamanzhu]

17:15.079 --> 17:18.519
I hope not to be a woman in the next life

17:21.799 --> 17:26.039
but to be a peony that blooms against the wind.

17:36.827 --> 17:42.632
[Huamanzhu]

17:44.559 --> 17:45.559
There is a letter.

17:49.000 --> 17:52.039
Mudan, no one else can help me.

17:53.359 --> 17:55.160
I have to ask you for help.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.920
Please inform my family of my situation.

17:58.559 --> 18:00.200
If my brother Liulang comes to you,

18:01.000 --> 18:02.440
please treat him kindly.

18:03.720 --> 18:05.880
Not good, something's happened to Shengyi.

18:05.880 --> 18:06.952
Quick, Fu.

18:07.480 --> 18:10.480
In this life, I have two wishes.

18:11.279 --> 18:13.720
First, may everything go smoothly for you.

18:14.880 --> 18:17.799
Second, may Liulang be healthy.

18:19.039 --> 18:21.880
Take care.

18:24.160 --> 18:25.319
You husband killer.

18:25.839 --> 18:29.319
Now that you've turned yourself in,
why not kneel and confess your guilt?

18:32.519 --> 18:35.960
The deceased, Wang Qing, got what he deserved.

18:37.839 --> 18:41.920
Although I killed him, I did justice.

18:42.759 --> 18:45.032
Nonsense, you are insane.

18:45.032 --> 18:46.200
Someone!

18:46.200 --> 18:47.304
- Yes.
- Yes.

18:51.480 --> 18:54.720
Are you committing crimes again?

18:54.720 --> 18:57.839
How dare you.
This is bodacious and intolerable.

19:00.799 --> 19:02.279
This is intolerable?

19:05.723 --> 19:08.072
[Rightness]

19:09.160 --> 19:10.519
A lowly person

19:12.720 --> 19:17.079
has to be trampled and crushed
by the ways of the world.

19:18.720 --> 19:21.359
That should be intolerable.

19:45.799 --> 19:47.640
I've been suffering

19:49.880 --> 19:51.920
at the mercy of others.

19:55.799 --> 19:56.968
In the end,

19:58.480 --> 20:02.039
I have to be killed by this unjust world.

20:12.880 --> 20:14.880
I couldn't choose how to live.

20:16.880 --> 20:19.759
But I can choose how to die.

20:21.832 --> 20:22.920
She killed herself.

20:22.920 --> 20:24.200
Make way!

20:25.599 --> 20:26.792
Shengyi!

20:27.480 --> 20:30.440
- Shengyi!
- Shengyi!

20:30.440 --> 20:31.519
Shengyi!

20:32.279 --> 20:33.640
Shengyi!

20:34.400 --> 20:36.000
- Shengyi!
- Shengyi!

20:37.759 --> 20:40.920
Shengyi!

20:44.839 --> 20:47.839
Shengyi!

20:48.519 --> 20:49.880
Shengyi!

20:49.880 --> 20:53.640
♫ A man should protect his family ♫

20:54.319 --> 20:57.680
Wuniang, with me,
you may still live a hard life.

20:58.359 --> 20:59.400
But I promise you.

21:00.240 --> 21:02.240
No one will dare to bully or insult you again.

21:03.119 --> 21:05.519
Are you willing to live with me?

21:05.519 --> 21:10.312
♫ Looking into the distance in the wind ♫

21:10.312 --> 21:15.752
♫ As a daughter ♫

21:15.752 --> 21:20.104
♫ My family didn't love me ♫

21:21.224 --> 21:25.928
♫ After growing up, I ran away ♫

21:26.632 --> 21:30.888
♫ Yet I felt ashamed to meet anyone ♫

21:31.784 --> 21:36.552
♫ Tears filled my eyes ♫

21:37.224 --> 21:41.544
♫ Covering my face ♫

21:45.880 --> 21:47.640
You are no longer Qin Wuniang.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.359
You are Qin Shengyi.

21:50.440 --> 21:55.432
♫ I used to have a good man ♫

21:55.432 --> 22:00.648
♫ We were lovers ♫

22:00.648 --> 22:05.992
♫ But now, we're strangers ♫

22:07.079 --> 22:08.680
Shengyi!

22:08.680 --> 22:10.359
- Shengyi!
- Shengyi!

22:10.920 --> 22:12.559
- Shengyi!
- Shengyi!

22:15.119 --> 22:16.279
Shengyi!

22:17.039 --> 22:18.440
Shengyi!

22:18.440 --> 22:22.472
♫ It's been a while ♫

22:22.472 --> 22:27.720
♫ Since we met ♫

22:31.319 --> 22:32.319
Shengyi.

22:35.160 --> 22:39.200
Next spring, Huaixiuxiang will blossom again.

22:40.839 --> 22:44.039
Then, I will come to see you again.

22:47.291 --> 22:49.119
[Qin Shengyi]

22:49.119 --> 22:52.839
You must often come into my dreams

22:54.279 --> 22:57.039
to talk with me, okay?

23:06.843 --> 23:11.799
♫ I've been suffering as a woman ♫

23:11.799 --> 23:12.839
Shengyi.

23:15.039 --> 23:16.039
Well,

23:18.359 --> 23:20.559
may you be happy and live well

23:23.519 --> 23:24.599
in your next life.

23:24.599 --> 23:27.368
♫ Since we met ♫

23:28.392 --> 23:38.312
♫ Since we met ♫

24:09.519 --> 24:11.920
If Li Xing sees books being burned
in my mansion,

24:12.880 --> 24:15.160
he will write poems to curse me
for disgracing the literati.

24:16.319 --> 24:18.920
Shengyi's story has been written in books.

24:20.319 --> 24:22.680
Outsiders have vilified her as a cruel woman,

24:23.720 --> 24:26.400
wishing to see her executed severely.

24:28.079 --> 24:30.000
How could I watch those
who are ignorant of the truth

24:30.799 --> 24:32.960
slander and misunderstand her?

24:35.319 --> 24:39.160
So you bought the books and burned them.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.319
If Shengyi knows it,

24:54.799 --> 24:58.640
she must be gratified for what you did for her.

25:03.559 --> 25:05.119
The last time I met her,

25:08.519 --> 25:09.599
she just stood there.

25:11.519 --> 25:14.640
She talked to me a lot.

25:17.839 --> 25:19.480
Then, I realized

25:20.480 --> 25:22.960
that I was lucky to survive.

25:25.200 --> 25:27.359
Not everyone has the opportunity to choose.

25:28.440 --> 25:30.119
Many people silently disappeared

25:31.279 --> 25:33.039
like Shengyi.

25:34.319 --> 25:35.880
Yet no one cares about them

25:37.864 --> 25:39.119
and laments for them.

25:42.759 --> 25:46.559
The women in this world are like this cup.

25:47.680 --> 25:51.039
Whether it's filled
with sweet water or bitter one,

25:51.880 --> 25:53.160
it has to take it all.

25:54.680 --> 25:56.759
And the people holding the cup
don't even need to ask.

25:57.680 --> 26:00.400
They can just spill the water

26:02.039 --> 26:04.000
and throw away this fragile cup.

26:12.559 --> 26:16.599
Are you referring to the men?

26:19.480 --> 26:23.799
No, I'm talking about this unfair world
to the women.

26:32.000 --> 26:36.200
So you want to write stories for this?

26:38.160 --> 26:41.720
Yes, I want to write a story about Shengyi

26:41.720 --> 26:43.279
from a woman's perspective

26:43.960 --> 26:45.680
to let the people know
about the sins of Wang Qing

26:46.279 --> 26:47.319
and the difficulty of being a woman.

26:48.799 --> 26:49.896
What about the ending?

26:50.839 --> 26:51.880
Have you thought it through?

26:55.319 --> 26:56.400
Qin Wuniang is dead.

26:58.680 --> 27:01.240
But Qin Shengyi will get a divorce
and gain independence

27:01.759 --> 27:02.960
and live happily in the story.

27:05.039 --> 27:06.559
I hope such an ending

27:07.480 --> 27:10.319
will give courage to the women
who are suffering

27:12.079 --> 27:13.720
and encourage them to cherish themselves

27:14.920 --> 27:16.319
and value their own lives.

27:23.680 --> 27:27.200
And I will manage Huamanzhu well.

27:28.640 --> 27:30.359
I want everyone to know

27:30.359 --> 27:33.599
that we women can also achieve great things.

27:40.920 --> 27:43.039
The woman I admired most was my aunt.

27:45.160 --> 27:47.119
I thought she was the most carefree.

27:49.519 --> 27:50.600
I start to admire you now.

27:52.039 --> 27:53.599
You can stand by.

27:55.359 --> 27:58.680
Yet you're brave and merciful to others.

28:01.799 --> 28:03.440
I am not as great as you say.

28:04.440 --> 28:06.920
All women share the same fate.

28:08.160 --> 28:12.319
Only by supporting each other
can we survive on our own.

28:21.435 --> 28:25.416
[Huamanzhu]

28:29.160 --> 28:30.160
Here it is.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.208
Thank you.

28:31.208 --> 28:32.279
Welcome to come again.

28:32.279 --> 28:33.352
Take care.

28:37.359 --> 28:39.599
Recently, not a rich man
has come to order flowers.

28:39.599 --> 28:42.088
Previously, two orders were canceled.

28:42.728 --> 28:43.880
Have a look.

28:47.680 --> 28:50.359
The rent in the East Market is more expensive
than that in the West Market.

28:50.920 --> 28:53.160
What should we do?

28:55.200 --> 28:57.319
Fu, you watch the store.

28:57.319 --> 28:59.400
I'll go ask these customers

28:59.400 --> 29:00.519
why they no longer buy our flowers.

29:08.720 --> 29:09.800
Rose.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.599
Mr. Jiang, Mr. Tang.

29:14.640 --> 29:17.720
Are you here to buy something for a banquet?

29:18.880 --> 29:20.799
For his favorite dancer's birthday.

29:20.799 --> 29:22.640
Help him choose some rare flowers.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.200
Deliver them to Huanyun Tower in three days.

29:24.759 --> 29:29.359
Alright, what color does the dancer like?

29:29.359 --> 29:30.920
Are there any aversions to fragrances?

29:31.519 --> 29:33.400
The brighter the color, the better;
the stronger the scent, the better.

29:33.960 --> 29:36.039
Understood, please take a look.

29:36.559 --> 29:38.480
Mr. Tang was right.

29:38.480 --> 29:41.160
Indeed, hardly anyone visits this shop.

29:44.759 --> 29:46.839
Mr. Tang, have you heard something?

29:48.920 --> 29:52.319
Did Liu Chang see you a few days ago?

29:55.359 --> 29:56.559
Well…

29:56.559 --> 29:58.480
The County Princess held a floral banquet
a few days ago.

29:58.480 --> 30:00.279
She invited all the noble ladies in the city

30:00.279 --> 30:03.039
and hinted to them deliberately

30:03.039 --> 30:05.319
that whoever bought flowers from Huamanzhu

30:05.319 --> 30:08.000
would be barred from her house.

30:10.480 --> 30:12.160
That's so absurd.

30:12.160 --> 30:13.680
Liu Chang got drunk that day.

30:14.519 --> 30:15.839
What does it have to do with me?

30:16.960 --> 30:18.359
The County Princess is besotted.

30:18.359 --> 30:20.119
She can't get his man's heart.

30:20.119 --> 30:21.799
So she takes it out on you.

30:21.799 --> 30:24.079
Suizhi, I came only because of you.

30:24.759 --> 30:27.200
I know. Pick your flowers.

30:29.480 --> 30:31.200
Fu, take care of him.

30:33.960 --> 30:37.160
The earnings from today's order are mine.

30:40.799 --> 30:42.039
This is blossoming well.

30:42.696 --> 30:43.944
I take five of them.

30:43.944 --> 30:45.039
Okay.

30:45.039 --> 30:46.759
And five of the purple ones over there.

30:46.759 --> 30:48.200
Okay.

30:48.200 --> 30:51.480
The County Princess
has given this new shop a hard time.

30:51.480 --> 30:52.599
Do you have any plans for this?

30:54.119 --> 30:56.519
She can stop the ladies from buying my flowers.

30:56.519 --> 30:57.704
However,

30:57.704 --> 31:01.039
she can't stop them from going
to some places that need flowers,

31:01.039 --> 31:03.599
not to mention those places frequented
by all sorts of people.

31:04.599 --> 31:06.839
Next to the East Market is Pingkang House.

31:06.839 --> 31:08.079
Besides Pingkang House,

31:08.079 --> 31:10.680
there are many taverns and dance houses.

31:10.680 --> 31:12.519
Mr. Jiang, you know it better than I do, right?

31:14.000 --> 31:15.279
A crisis means an opportunity.

31:15.920 --> 31:17.960
It seems my worry was unnecessary.

31:18.880 --> 31:21.079
You are my business partner.

31:21.799 --> 31:24.720
I know, besides the Huanyun Tower,

31:24.720 --> 31:27.359
you also bought a tavern
from the nomadic people.

31:28.480 --> 31:31.240
Anyway, fresh flowers are needed
for decorations.

31:31.240 --> 31:33.480
How about you order them Huamanzhu?

31:34.480 --> 31:38.359
I can give you a ten percent discount.

31:40.240 --> 31:42.960
It's not my style to refuse a discount.

31:42.960 --> 31:45.759
However, I want a 20 percent discount.

31:48.599 --> 31:50.960
You never let me down.

31:50.960 --> 31:53.200
You're as mean as ever.

31:53.200 --> 31:55.960
I haven't asked you for more monthly dividends.

31:55.960 --> 31:57.440
I'm already being reasonable.

31:58.160 --> 32:00.359
Okay, a 20 percent discount.

32:00.359 --> 32:01.480
It's a deal.

32:14.880 --> 32:16.440
As you say,

32:16.440 --> 32:18.319
I'll deliver flowers
at the beginning of each month.

32:18.319 --> 32:20.799
If more flowers are required during a festival,

32:20.799 --> 32:22.079
I will prepare them in advance.

32:23.079 --> 32:25.559
If you have any demands, feel free to tell me.

32:26.079 --> 32:29.640
I heard the flowers at Madame Tang's banquet
were highly praised.

32:29.640 --> 32:32.400
Huanyun Tower wants some new flowers.

32:32.400 --> 32:34.039
Do you have any good ideas?

32:34.039 --> 32:35.160
Don't touch it.

32:39.359 --> 32:40.392
Hand!

32:41.079 --> 32:44.079
The guests here like new stuff.

32:44.079 --> 32:46.640
Could you take me to see the dancers?

32:47.319 --> 32:50.039
Each lead dancer has her own signature flower,

32:50.039 --> 32:52.599
and the flowers change during the performance.

32:52.599 --> 32:55.240
Different flowers every night. What do you say?

32:56.599 --> 32:59.000
Good idea. It's worth a try.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.032
Please.

33:03.200 --> 33:04.720
Stop slandering me.

33:04.720 --> 33:06.480
Everyone ate those pastries yesterday.

33:06.480 --> 33:08.400
How come you're the only one who got sores?

33:09.000 --> 33:10.120
Yunniang.

33:18.000 --> 33:19.559
No one is harming you.

33:19.559 --> 33:21.279
Did you not properly remove your makeup

33:21.279 --> 33:22.480
before going to sleep?

33:25.519 --> 33:27.920
I was drunk and forgot.

33:30.000 --> 33:32.039
You have to put on makeup every day.

33:32.039 --> 33:34.039
If you don't take it off before you go to bed,

33:34.599 --> 33:36.079
and the next day

33:36.079 --> 33:37.440
you put on new makeup,

33:37.960 --> 33:39.519
gradually,

33:39.519 --> 33:41.599
your skin will become bad.

33:42.400 --> 33:45.079
Ladies, this powder is coarsely ground

33:45.079 --> 33:46.440
and contains heavy amounts of lead.

33:46.440 --> 33:47.640
If you use it daily,

33:47.640 --> 33:49.839
your skin will get worse.

33:51.519 --> 33:54.039
The dancers must put on makeup to perform.

33:54.039 --> 33:55.759
Good makeup powder is expensive.

33:55.759 --> 33:57.799
We can't afford to use it every day.

34:08.200 --> 34:09.440
Since we have orders from Pingkang House,

34:09.440 --> 34:11.440
dance houses, and taverns,

34:11.440 --> 34:13.880
our business
in the East Market is getting better.

34:13.880 --> 34:16.599
But the revenue has dropped
by 40 percent compared to before.

34:18.320 --> 34:20.760
There is nothing else we can do.

34:20.760 --> 34:23.000
Anyway, let's focus our efforts on this.

34:23.760 --> 34:26.360
We attract more customers

34:26.360 --> 34:28.679
so that our business
in the West Market can also get better.

34:30.000 --> 34:31.679
To my surprise,
you found a business opportunity

34:31.679 --> 34:32.719
in Huanyun Tower.

34:33.760 --> 34:36.960
There are many business opportunities
to be found.

34:36.960 --> 34:40.760
For instance, we need bath beans
for facial cleaning and bathing.

34:40.760 --> 34:42.800
After bathing, we need skin powder

34:42.800 --> 34:44.639
and hair balm.

34:44.639 --> 34:46.239
When we women go out to meet friends,

34:46.239 --> 34:48.559
we need to put on makeup and lip rouge.

34:48.559 --> 34:50.280
Look at these bath beans.

34:50.280 --> 34:52.199
They are sold in the West Market.

34:52.760 --> 34:55.400
But they are too expensive
for the common folks.

34:56.159 --> 34:59.320
If we can develop cheaper bath beans,

34:59.320 --> 35:01.119
it will benefit more people.

35:02.400 --> 35:03.719
Perhaps we can improve the bath beans

35:03.719 --> 35:06.119
based on the old formula.

35:06.719 --> 35:09.039
Great, that would be wonderful.

35:10.039 --> 35:11.360
When my family had no money,

35:11.360 --> 35:13.519
my mother didn't use bath beans for bathing

35:13.519 --> 35:15.440
and left them to me.

35:15.440 --> 35:16.639
At that time, I thought

35:16.639 --> 35:18.920
if only the bath beans could be cheaper.

35:19.880 --> 35:22.000
I do business because I hope

35:22.000 --> 35:23.920
that whether poor or rich,

35:23.920 --> 35:25.480
everyone can enjoy the beauty.

35:26.159 --> 35:28.280
But Jiang Changyang was right.

35:28.800 --> 35:32.039
Most people are toiling for their livelihood.

35:32.039 --> 35:34.760
They have no time
to watch the useless beauty of these flowers.

35:36.800 --> 35:38.800
Growing flowers requires patience.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.239
Take me for example.

35:40.239 --> 35:42.679
If I'm too tired from practicing medicine,

35:42.679 --> 35:44.960
I won't want to attend to the flowers.

35:45.840 --> 35:47.400
I once biasedly thought

35:47.400 --> 35:49.159
that beauty had only one form.

35:49.159 --> 35:52.760
Now, I think a clean appearance
and a fresh scent

35:52.760 --> 35:54.199
reflect the common folk's love for beauty.

35:54.920 --> 35:56.039
The thousands of common folks

35:56.039 --> 35:58.280
are our biggest patrons.

35:58.280 --> 36:00.559
As long as we develop good makeup goods

36:00.559 --> 36:01.679
and establish a good reputation,

36:01.679 --> 36:03.559
making our goods available for everyone,

36:04.079 --> 36:07.320
the County Princess, or even the Princess,
can't give us a hard time.

36:07.320 --> 36:09.599
Even if the nobles never come again,

36:09.599 --> 36:12.159
our business will not be closed.

36:12.159 --> 36:13.288
That's right.

36:29.320 --> 36:32.079
Zhu Fu doesn't have the fragrance of incense

36:32.079 --> 36:33.719
for the rich.

36:40.159 --> 36:42.079
Chuanyu, come closer.

36:44.199 --> 36:45.256
My lord.

36:46.159 --> 36:47.840
Is the fragrance on me too strong?

36:54.719 --> 36:55.848
Not at all.

36:57.360 --> 37:00.648
Perhaps I've grown accustomed to it
after being with you for so long.

37:03.840 --> 37:05.559
My lord, smell me.

37:05.559 --> 37:07.239
Smell me.

37:07.239 --> 37:08.296
See if I smell good.

37:10.559 --> 37:11.656
You've bathed?

37:12.320 --> 37:14.599
Fu gave me three bath beans.

37:15.360 --> 37:16.679
She asked me to tell her which one I liked more

37:16.679 --> 37:17.760
after I've used them.

37:18.679 --> 37:21.239
She's using you as a tester, you fool.

37:22.239 --> 37:24.960
Anyway, my lady doesn't give you one.

37:25.840 --> 37:27.199
I've heard Fu say

37:27.199 --> 37:30.559
that Lady He has been dressing up these days.

37:31.280 --> 37:33.599
She puts on skin powder,

37:33.599 --> 37:35.080
hair balm,

37:35.080 --> 37:36.123
and lip rouge.

37:36.679 --> 37:37.800
You know,

37:38.440 --> 37:40.559
a woman dresses up for a man she likes.

37:41.679 --> 37:44.000
So, I guess

37:44.000 --> 37:45.639
Lady He has met a kind

37:45.639 --> 37:47.519
and considerate man in her store.

38:08.320 --> 38:10.360
Jiang Changyang, what's wrong with you?

38:10.360 --> 38:11.360
You scared me.

38:14.880 --> 38:16.440
[Who marries first is a dog. Suizhi.]
I'm here to remind you.

38:16.440 --> 38:18.599
Prepare the money you're going to lose.

38:19.199 --> 38:20.320
I'm not getting married.

38:20.320 --> 38:21.519
What makes you think I'll lose?

38:27.840 --> 38:30.559
Then why are you putting on makeup?

38:31.920 --> 38:34.239
Huamanzhu is about to launch makeup products.

38:34.239 --> 38:36.880
I'm trying them on my face.

38:36.880 --> 38:38.119
I need to try them one by one.

38:39.800 --> 38:41.519
Just forget the bet.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.760
If you scare me again,

38:44.760 --> 38:46.480
I'll close that back door

38:46.480 --> 38:47.880
to stop you from coming again.

38:55.719 --> 38:58.239
Take a look. Which color looks good?

38:58.239 --> 38:59.912
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

38:59.912 --> 39:03.112
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

39:04.079 --> 39:05.224
They all look good.

39:07.320 --> 39:09.239
Never mind. I shouldn't have asked you.

39:10.152 --> 39:12.456
♫ If love is like frost ♫

39:12.456 --> 39:16.904
♫ Can this ten thousand miles
of roaming winds and waves ♫

39:16.904 --> 39:22.376
♫ Finally touch a sunny day ♫

39:25.800 --> 39:28.119
Ever since Cheng Lang took office
in Eastern Capital,

39:28.840 --> 39:32.039
the land occupation
of the noble has been curbed.

39:33.519 --> 39:36.000
The farmers in Luoyang
have reclaimed their land.

39:36.000 --> 39:37.000
They're farming hard

39:37.000 --> 39:38.039
for the autumn harvest.

39:41.000 --> 39:43.559
The case of the Chen family
involves many people.

39:44.119 --> 39:45.159
Still, we failed

39:45.159 --> 39:46.840
to find any solid evidence
of their collusion with Prince Ning.

39:47.599 --> 39:49.960
Your brother is cunning.

39:49.960 --> 39:51.559
He's extricated himself completely.

39:53.199 --> 39:55.880
But the peace of a nation

39:55.880 --> 39:59.119
relies on the officials, farmland,
money, and the army.

40:00.760 --> 40:03.960
Now, all the corrupt officials
who occupied the land have been removed.

40:03.960 --> 40:05.679
The nation is becoming increasingly rich.

40:05.679 --> 40:07.880
We have made substantial progress.

40:08.599 --> 40:12.840
Next, we just need to focus on the last step.

40:13.760 --> 40:16.639
Accusing Prince Ning is just around the corner.

40:20.639 --> 40:22.599
Since Prince Ning's daughter got engaged
to Liu Chang again,

40:23.320 --> 40:25.159
Prince Ning has started
to connect with the nobility.

40:25.800 --> 40:27.400
Now, he can no longer wait.

40:27.920 --> 40:29.840
He wants to interfere with the appointment
and removal of officials.

40:30.679 --> 40:32.079
If we push him too hard,

40:32.960 --> 40:34.239
I'm afraid he will be suspicious.

40:44.800 --> 40:46.400
Rather than stopping him,

40:47.000 --> 40:50.360
it's better to give him one position.

40:53.880 --> 40:56.760
Which position is on your mind?

40:59.519 --> 41:00.840
Deputy Transport Officer in charge of channels.

41:03.800 --> 41:06.199
After Mr. Hu was removed,
Lu Chu took his place.

41:06.920 --> 41:08.679
The Deputy Transport Officer has real power,

41:08.679 --> 41:11.440
but Lu Chu can stop him from making waves.

41:11.960 --> 41:14.960
Exactly, if he takes any action,

41:15.480 --> 41:18.079
we'll get the evidence of guilt directly.

41:25.159 --> 41:27.800
Lady Mudan works really well with you.

41:27.800 --> 41:29.440
Seems like you two are old friends.

41:29.440 --> 41:31.119
She has helped us so much.

41:31.119 --> 41:33.079
Have you thanked her for me?

41:33.079 --> 41:34.239
She works well with me?

41:35.159 --> 41:36.920
That's because it's all well-planned.

41:38.440 --> 41:40.079
Well,

41:40.079 --> 41:43.039
she prefers a bar of gold than thanks.

42:04.411 --> 42:10.685
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:12.539 --> 42:19.223
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:19.899 --> 42:27.097
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:28.091 --> 42:36.443
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:36.443 --> 42:43.986
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:44.640 --> 42:52.827
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:52.827 --> 43:00.638
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:01.243 --> 43:08.535
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:29.211 --> 43:36.094
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:37.395 --> 43:44.089
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:44.846 --> 43:52.148
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:52.832 --> 44:01.141
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

44:01.141 --> 44:08.572
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:09.403 --> 44:17.659
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:17.659 --> 44:25.083
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:26.087 --> 44:33.537
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
